{"schema":1,"revision":94318594,"page":{"pageid":2888180,"title":"烤鸡","displayTitle":"烤雞","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:RotisserieChicken.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/RotisserieChicken.jpg/250px-RotisserieChicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"158\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/RotisserieChicken.jpg/500px-RotisserieChicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2882\" data-file-height=\"1827\" /></a><figcaption>烤雞</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Roast_chicken.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Roast_chicken.jpg/250px-Roast_chicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"192\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/Roast_chicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"480\" data-file-height=\"368\" /></a><figcaption>烤雞</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Roasted_chicken.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Roasted_chicken.jpg/250px-Roasted_chicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"204\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/Roasted_chicken.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"367\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a><figcaption>烤雞</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>烤雞</b>，又稱<b>燒雞</b>，指將全雞或雞件置於烤箱、明火等高溫烹調方式下，讓雞肉大部分不直接接觸熱源，以此將其烤熟的烹飪做法。\n</p><p>於北美，雞肉通常會用番茄製成的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%87%92%E7%83%A4%E9%86%AC\" title=\"燒烤醬\">燒烤醬</a>醃製，然後燒烤。\n</p><p>於歐洲，雞肉會用醋和<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A9%84%E6%AC%96%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"橄欖油\">橄欖油</a>混合的醃料醃製、燒烤，食用時點上奶油醬汁。\n</p><p>於亞洲，雞肉有時會切粒，用豉油及其他<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%83%E5%91%B3%E6%96%99\" title=\"調味料\">調味料</a>醃製，串在竹支上燒烤。是中秋節的必要食品。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"相關條目\"><span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E9.97.9C.E6.A2.9D.E7.9B.AE\"></span>相關條目</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%83%A4%E9%B8%A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：相關條目\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A1%B6%E4%BB%94%E9%9B%9E\" title=\"桶仔雞\">桶仔雞</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"泰式烤雞\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Kai yang\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%B3%B0%E5%BC%8F%E7%83%A4%E9%9B%9E&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"泰式烤雞（頁面不存在）\">泰式烤雞</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kai_yang\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Kai yang\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Kai yang</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li>\n<li>蒙古烤雞</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%82%B8%E9%9B%9E\" title=\"炸雞\">炸雞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%87%92%E7%83%A4\" title=\"燒烤\">燒烤</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%83%A4%E9%B4%A8\" title=\"烤鴨\">烤鴨</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83\"></span>參考</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%83%A4%E9%B8%A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Stines, Michael H. (2005) <i>Mastering barbecue: tons of recipes, neat techniques, great tips and indispensable know how</i> Ten Speed Press, <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1580086624\" class=\"internal mw-magiclink-isbn\">ISBN 1-58008-662-4</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173189\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.m